"""New vocab cards for 12 V & 48 V Electrical (pack e12). Row = [term, plain meaning, shop tip].
Sources: SAE J537 (battery ratings), BCI battery service guidance, ISO 21780 (48 V systems),
maker service info conventions, Fluke/Pico meter and scope application notes. Easy words first within each list."""

